  "description": "Roland D-50 LA strings: a glassy inharmonic FM transient (the PCM attack partial) over a slow tilted-saw synth partial whose brightness blooms through the held note. Play C3–C6 — the transient rings above C5 — in open 3–4-note voicings, gate 0.5 s or longer; velocity brings the attack forward, mod wheel adds vibrato and opens the filter. Mixer: plate send 0.45 (the D-50 reverb is half the sound); chorus rate 0.5 Hz, depth 2 ms, spread 0.7, mix 0.45; low cut 80 Hz.",
